    "在 Mac 上开个终端标签就会出现在这里": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open a terminal tab on your Mac and it will show up here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Mac 的 设置 → 远程 里点「生成配对码」,把 6 位数字输进来": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the Mac, open Settings → Remote and tap Generate pairing code, then type the 6 digits here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
