    "左滑可改名或移除;移除会一并删除本机保存的访问密钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe left to rename or remove. Removing also deletes the stored access key on this device."
